{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港鐵東涌綫往香港方向的列車，今日起改行接駁東涌東站的新路段。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">東涌綫往香港方向的列車，離開東涌站後進入隧道，出隧道後，會駛過未開放的東涌東站月台，整體行車時間與之前大致相若，列車班次維持不變，港鐵管理層及鐵路迷一同乘坐首班車。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MTR-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026H1dAU4OIVG1789286419.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MTR-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港鐵表示改行新路段後，服務大致暢順，會繼續監察運作。工程團隊隨後將開始東涌綫延綫項目下一階段工程，包括拆除舊路軌、鋪設新路軌，以及在今年底及明年再進行道岔安裝工序。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MTR-1300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ZBYKOJpRLM1789286442.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MTR-1300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T08:18:47.781196+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}